plugin-hostd (0.1.4) unstable; urgency=medium

  * When a plugin worker cannot get its network ports because another process
    took them first, the daemon now starts it again on fresh ports, up to
    three tries, instead of giving up. This fixes the occasional "-503" when
    adding a plugin.
  * The JACK test now also runs on JACK2's jackd, and the continuous checks
    use pinned versions of the tools they build with.

